5. If a full grid is available, verify intersection counts and flag suspicious uniform outputs such as all 1 or all -1 unless fully justified.
6. When proposing a full candidate, include a compact mismatch report listing any numbered intersections that seem violated.

Do not output a final code block unless you are writing a candidate full grid inside the document as plain text notes.
Never leave the document empty.

Problem:
{problem}

Current shared document:
{document}

Agent: {agent_id}
Round: {round}
"""

SLANT_SHARED_AGGREGATOR_PROMPT = """
Using the puzzle and the final shared document, produce the best draft Slant answer.

Hard requirements:
- output exactly one plain triple-backtick code block and no extra text;
