- if the puzzle number grid is N x N, output exactly (N-1) rows and (N-1) columns;
- do not use a language tag after the opening backticks;
- do not output an empty code block;
- do not output a uniform all-1 or all--1 grid unless the shared document proves it satisfies the constraints;
- prefer the candidate with the fewest stated intersection mismatches;
- if multiple candidates appear, prefer the one whose row/column size is correct and whose local numbered constraints are most explicitly checked.

Problem:
{problem}

Shared document:
{document}
"""

